# BudgetX backend environment
Copy to `.env` and adjust. Never commit your real `.env`.

SECRET_KEY=generate-a-long-random-string-hex-or-uuid
DATABASE_URL=sqlite:///./budgetx.db
ENVIRONMENT=development
ACCESS_TOKEN_EXPIRE_MINUTES=30
REFRESH_TOKEN_EXPIRE_DAYS=14

CORS_ORIGINS=["http://localhost:5173","http://127.0.0.1:5173"]

For PostgreSQL (after `docker compose up -d db`):
DATABASE_URL=postgresql+psycopg://budgetx:budgetx@localhost:5432/budgetx
